"privacyDataDesc": "Feature settings and personal-use records may be stored locally on your device. This can include prayer settings and selected location, notification and appearance preferences, New Muslim Journey progress, Quran reading progress and bookmarks, reader settings and worship activity records. IslamFull does not sell personal data, and the current app does not require an IslamFull account.",
